weeks)"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18339", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "The fetal growth continues and the focus of the concern now, is the risk to the upcoming birth process and the safety and comfort of the pregnant woman. It is safe to perform a routine dental treatment in the early part of the 3rd trimester.", "runs": [{"text": "The fetal growth continues and the focus of the concern now, is the risk to the upcoming birth process and the safety and comfort of the pregnant woman. It is safe to perform a routine dental treatment in the early part of the 3rd trimester."}]}, {"id": "body-18341", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Recommendations", "runs": [{"text": "Recommendations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-18342", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Maintenance of oral hygiene and plaque control.", "runs": [{"text": "Maintenance"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hygiene"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "plaque"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "control."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1082"}}, {"id": "body-18343", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "It’s safe to perform scaling, polishing and curettage if necessary.", "runs": [{"text": "It’s"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "safe"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "perform"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "scaling,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "polishing"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "curettage"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "if"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "necessary."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1082"}}, {"id": "body-18344", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Active oral diseases should be controlled.", "runs": [{"text": "Active"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diseases"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "controlled."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1082"}}, {"id": "body-18345", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "It’s safe to perform elective procedures.", "runs": [{"text": "It’s"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "safe"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "perform"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "elective"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "procedures."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1082"}}, {"id": "body-18346", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "The radiograph use should be minimized.", "runs": [{"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "radiograph"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "use"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "minimized."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1082"}}, {"id": "body-18347", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Procedures should not to be performed after mid time of the third trimester, unless it is emergency or life threatening condition", "runs": [{"text": "Procedures"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "performed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "after"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "time"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "third"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "trimester,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "unless"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "it"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "emergency or life threatening condition"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1082"}}, {"id": "body-18348-textbox1-00001", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Note: Pregnancy should not be considered as an absolute reason to deny required dental care. Pregnant patients must be educated about the importance of maintaining good oral hygiene, expected changes in the oral cavity and routine dental visits.", "